WEBVTT

00:12:25.616 --> 00:12:31.038
to replace the undiagnosed
bias with empathy.

00:12:32.748 --> 00:12:38.754
And to all of you out there
who are suffering with chronic pain,

00:12:38.754 --> 00:12:39.922
we hear you.

00:12:40.547 --> 00:12:43.258
And we're ready to listen.

00:12:44.635 --> 00:12:45.844
Thank you.

00:12:45.844 --> 00:12:47.012
(Applause)